# The front and back views of the keys above stay as they were (D and U frames are frozen in the P2B rollout): empty views
# say so, so the mail draws nothing there exactly as before (a later D/U pass may draw them).
view D key runF origin 0 0
|.

view U key runF origin 0 0
|.

view D key oback origin 0 0
|.

view U key oback origin 0 0
|.

view D key oidle origin 0 0
|.

view U key oidle origin 0 0
|.

view D key orunF origin 0 0
|.

view U key orunF origin 0 0
|.

# ---- (P2c SLICE-ARMOUR, ADD) the fall's `fling`; `ofwd` facing down and up is drawn by the torso (empty, as oback / oidle)

